# Third-party notices

@PROJECT_NAME@ is MIT licensed; see LICENSE in the folder above. It statically links
the libraries below, and each directory here holds that library's own licence file,
copied verbatim from the revision this build used. The exception is debugdraw-font/,
which covers data/debugdraw.font.yc, an atlas made from the Inconsolata typeface,
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Several of these libraries vendor further components of their own. Those are not
copied here; they are covered by, and traceable from, the upstream project whose
directory you find them under.
